Check the version file before any scan or draft:

- This platform has mhk files but no entry → stop: they predate version tracking; run {{migrate_command}} first.
- The entry is newer than {{version}} → stop: a newer mhk wrote these files; update mhk first.
- A note for the layer you write is pending → stop: run {{migrate_command}} first.
- The file isn't valid JSON, or the entry isn't a version → stop and ask the user to fix it.

Otherwise continue and leave the entry unchanged: only {{migrate_command}} moves it. The exception is a platform's first mhk files: when this platform has no mhk files and no entry, add the entry with {{version}} to the same diff, creating the file if it is missing.
